# User-secrets (dotnet user-secrets stores here during dev)
# Real path is outside the repo, but guard any accidental copies
**/secrets/**

# The tool's own saved connection profiles live outside the repo at
# ~/.sql-database-checkpoints/connections.json — guarded here in case
# someone copies the file into the project directory.
connections.json

